-- src:1066 | - Cung cấp xác nhận bảo lãnh thanh toán theo yêu cầu của bệnh viện.
-- src:1067 | - Thanh toán chi phí y tế thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm trực tiếp với bệnh viện.
GIVEN `age in years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a copy of the birth certificate stands for the identity card at age` `age in years` IF
    `age in years` LESS THAN 14

-- The clock counts days from discharge; "before leaving hospital" is day 0.
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`VII the insured's duty to pay what direct billing does not cover` MEANS
    PARTY `the insured person or their heir`
    MUST  `pay the costs above the limit or outside the cover`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insured person or their heir` BECAUSE "costs above the limit or outside the cover were not paid before leaving hospital (VII)"

§§ `Outside the network: the time limits`

-- The claim file goes to PTI's or Gras Savoye Willis VN's claims unit within 120 days of
-- the last day of treatment of each accident or illness: for a hospital stay or day
-- treatment, the day of discharge; for outpatient treatment, the day of the diagnosis
-- result. Supplementary documents asked for: within 120 days of the request. At most one
-- year from the last day of treatment for one claim file. Late files are refused, except
-- for force majeure.
-- src:1070 | ĐIỀU TRỊ NỘI TRÚ VÀ NGOẠI TRÚ NGOÀI HỆ THỐNG BẢO LÃNH VIỆN PHÍ
-- src:1071 | CỦA CÔNG TY TƯ VẤN BẢO HIỂM GRAS SAVOYE WILLIS VN
-- src:1072 | Thời hạn nộp hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi thường
-- src:1073 | Người được bảo hiểm hoặc người thừa kế hợp pháp phải nộp hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi thường cho
-- src:1074 | bộ phận giải quyết bồi thường của PTI hoặc của Gras Savoye Willis VN (phòng TPA) trong
-- src:1075 | vòng 120 ngày kể từ ngày điều trị cuối cùng của mỗi tai nạn hay bệnh tật. Đối với trường
-- src:1076 | hợp nằm viện hay điều trị trong ngày, ngày điều trị cuối cùng là ngày ra viện. Đối với
-- src:1077 | trường hợp điều trị ngoại trú, ngày điều trị cuối cùng là ngày có kết quả chẩn đoán bệnh.
-- src:1078 | Đối với các trường hợp hồ sơ bồi thường cần bổ sung chứng từ, thời hạn nộp hồ sơ bổ sung
-- src:1079 | là 120 ngày tính từ ngày gửi đề nghị bổ sung. Thời hạn tối đa cho 1 hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi
-- src:1080 | thường là 1 năm tính từ ngày điều trị cuối cùng.
-- src:1081 | Quá thời hạn trên, hồ sơ bồi thường sẽ bị từ chối bồi thường, trừ các trường hợp bất khả
-- src:1082 | kháng.
-- Fork F44: a claim with no course of treatment (death, permanent injury, allowance,
-- transport) counts from the day of the loss. Fork F49: these limits sit under the heading
-- for treatment OUTSIDE the direct billing network, and a claim through the network is not
-- held to them.
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day of treatment in` claim MEANS
    CONSIDER claim's `the outcome`
    WHEN `medical expenses` t items THEN
        IF   t's `setting` EQUALS `outpatient treatment`
        THEN t's `date of the diagnosis result`
        ELSE t's `last day`
    OTHERWISE claim's `date of the loss`

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`the day the claim file is due in` claim MEANS
    Date (Day (`the last day of treatment in` claim) PLUS 120)

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day for any claim file in` claim MEANS
    `add years` (`the last day of treatment in` claim) 1

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supplementary documents are in time in` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `the file`'s `date supplementary documents were requested`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST requested THEN
        CONSIDER claim's `the file`'s `date supplementary documents were submitted`
        WHEN NOTHING        THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST submitted THEN
                `days from` requested `to` submitted AT MOST 120
            AND submitted AT MOST `the last day for any claim file in` claim

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the claim file is in time in` claim IF
        claim's `the file`'s `through the direct billing network`
    OR  claim's `the file`'s `force majeure`
    OR  (    claim's `the file`'s `date the claim file was submitted` AT MOST `the day the claim file is due in` claim
         AND `the supplementary documents are in time in` claim)

-- An insured who has an accident (or the beneficiary or heir) must notify the insurer in
-- writing, on PTI's form, within 120 days of the accident; if not, PTI refuses payment.
-- src:1083 | Trường hợp NĐBH bị tai nạn thì NĐBH/người thụ hưởng/người thừa kế hợp pháp phải
-- src:1084 | thông báo cho Công ty bảo hiểm băng văn bản (theo mẫu thông báo tổn thât của PTI đính
-- src:1085 | kèm quy tắc này) trong vòng 120 ngày kể từ ngày bị tai nạn. Nếu NĐBH/người thụ
-- src:1086 | hưởng/người thừa kế hợp pháp không thông báo đúng thời hạn quy định thì PTI sẽ từ chối
-- src:1087 | thanh toán yêu cầu trả tiền bảo hiểm.
-- LAW fork L4: this clause has no force majeure exception; Law 08/2022/QH15 art 19(3)
-- (law-08-2022-qh15.txt line 441-444) forbids applying an exclusion for late notice where
-- force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the delay. Encoded as written; conflict
-- recorded, not resolved.
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the accident was notified in time in` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `the file`'s `date the accident was notified in writing`
    WHEN JUST d  THEN `days from` (claim's `the event`'s `date`) `to` d AT MOST 120
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- The documents must be sent within 12 months of the day of the accident; late files are
-- refused in part or in whole, except for force majeure.
-- src:1088 | Khi yêu cầu PTI bồi thường, người được bảo hiểm hoặc người thừa kế hợp pháp hoặc người
-- src:1089 | được ủy quyền phải gửi các chứng từ sau đây trong vòng 12 tháng kể từ ngày tai nạn. Quá
-- src:1090 | thời hạn trên, hồ sơ bồi thường sẽ bị từ chối một phần hoặc toàn bộ số tiền bồi thường, trừ
-- src:1091 | trường hợp bất khả kháng
-- Fork F45: this limit runs from "the day of the accident" and binds accident claims only.
-- How much is refused when it is missed ("một phần hoặc toàn bộ", part or all) is not
-- stated, so a late accident file is declined in amount (finding X13).
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the accident documents were sent in time in` claim IF
        claim's `the file`'s `force majeure`
    OR  claim's `the file`'s `date the documents were sent` AT MOST `add months` (claim's `the event`'s `date`) 12

GIVETH A NUMBER
`late accident documents are refused in part or in whole, and the document does not say how much` MEANS
    REFUSE "late accident documents are refused in part or in whole, and the document does not say how much"

-- Payment: within 10-15 working days of a complete file.
-- src:1092 | Thời gian thanh toán bồi thường: trong vòng 10-15 ngày làm việc đối với một hồ sơ đầy
-- src:1093 | đủ chứng từ.
-- Fork F46: PTI is in time if it pays by the 15th working day; working days are Monday to
-- Friday other than the public holidays supplied. LAW: law-08-2022-qh15.txt line 718-724
-- (art 31) requires payment within the time agreed, or 15 days where none is; the clause is
-- an agreed time.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      holidays  IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a working day` `the day` `given the holidays` holidays IF
        NOT `Weekday of` `the day` EQUALS 6
    AND NOT `Weekday of` `the day` EQUALS 0
    AND NOT elem `the day` holidays

GIVEN n          IS A NUMBER
      `the day`  IS A DATE
      holidays   IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the working day` n `after` `the day` `given the holidays` holidays MEANS
    IF   n AT MOST 0
    THEN `the day`
    ELSE IF   `a working day` `the next day` `given the holidays` holidays
         THEN `the working day` (n MINUS 1) `after` `the next day` `given the holidays` holidays
         ELSE `the working day` n `after` `the next day` `given the holidays` holidays
    WHERE
        `the next day` MEANS Date (Day `the day` PLUS 1)

GIVEN `the day the file was complete` IS A DATE
      holidays                        IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day for PTI to pay a file complete on` `the day the file was complete` `given the holidays` holidays MEANS
    `the working day` 15 `after` `the day the file was complete` `given the holidays` holidays

-- PTI's duty to pay, as a regulative rule; the clock counts calendar days from the day the
-- file was complete.
GIVEN `the day the file was complete` IS A DATE
      holidays                        IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`VII PTI's duty to pay a complete file from` `the day the file was complete` `given the holidays` holidays MEANS
    PARTY `PTI`
    MUST  `pay the claim`
    WITHIN `days from` `the day the file was complete` `to` (`the last day for PTI to pay a file complete on` `the day the file was complete` `given the holidays` holidays)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `PTI` BECAUSE "a complete claim file was not paid within 15 working days (VII)"

-- The insured's duty to submit, as a regulative rule; the clock counts calendar days from
-- the last day of treatment.
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`VII the duty to submit the claim file` MEANS
    PARTY `the insured person or their heir`
    MUST  `submit the claim file`
    WITHIN 120
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insured person or their heir` BECAUSE "the claim file was not submitted within 120 days of the last day of treatment (VII)"

§§ `The claim file: documents`

-- I. Inpatient treatment: 1. the claim form, stamped by the policyholder and signed by an
-- authorised person; 2. the papers of tests in the 30 days before admission; 3. the papers
-- of the stay (discharge paper, surgery certificate if operated, invoices, an itemised
-- statement if an invoice lumps costs together); 4. the papers of follow-up within 45 days
-- after discharge.
